  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Lani27/lord-of-mysteries-english-patch/zipball/v2.6.0",
  "body": "## Lord of Mysteries English Patch 2.6\n\n- Added a launcher that automatically downloads and verifies signed patcher-engine updates, so future supported logic changes no longer require manually replacing the executable.\n- Added startup verification, atomic engine activation, and recovery using the previous verified engine or the embedded offline engine.\n- Fixed Brass Book bounty descriptions staying Chinese after opening the panel or refreshing progress.\n- Fixed 10 translations with malformed rich-text closing tags, including the Mythical Forging material description.\n- Added 14 Gemini translations verified against game language-source records.\n- Retained the server-list and start-screen fixes, including the requested name \"Bacon of Destiny\", and all graphics from 2.5.\n- Included External DPS Meter Preview 7 and telemetry exporter 1.7.1. Export timers recover after player initialization on instance transfers and PvP state changes without accumulating duplicate timers.\n- Preview 7 retains all Preview 6 features. Live cross-server dungeon validation remains pending; this update does not claim to resolve every disconnect cause.\n- Install the 2.6 executable once. Future supported engine and translation updates can then download automatically through the launcher.\n\nThe Windows executable is not Authenticode-signed. Verify downloads against `SHA256SUMS.txt` if Windows displays an unknown-publisher warning.\n\nSource revision: `d4da3ddefc6d0b29877a9cd3bdb87f7dd3a1300d`"
